  "details": "I tried everything, reinstalling the creator companion entirely by deleting all files and by using the file \"uninstall.exe\" present in the VCC folders but I can not launch it, it makes me the error as indicated in the attached file. \n\nI will detail what I saw while trying to fix the error : \n\n1. VCC do not create a file \"settings.json\" when I launch it, even when I make a complete reinstallation.\n\n2. I’m on Shadow PC, but when I try with my boyfriend’s Shadow it works for reasons beyond my comprehension.\n\n3. My Webview2 works properly, but I can’t access the http://localhost:5476/ address so I can’t even see the web interface.\n\nSo there you go, if you have any solution at all I am taking it. Thank you in advance and have a good day ^^",
